      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should we highlight even more the operational advantages of having ACL + configuration? I think it will help in understanding the design and also help the admin during the migration.\n\nThe ones that come to mind are:\n- The ACL can be prepared before enforcement is enabled\n- Admin can enable the policy incrementally per project or provide a site-wide default in All-Projects \n- A project can temporarily disable enforcement without deleting its ACL design\n- A site can force enforcement through repository.*.defaultConfig\n\nWDYT?",
      "revId": "4b16f5cf06dc0ac919d7258de5ebd7c7000b75d0",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
