      "message": "Both the effective and the real (impersonating) user must hold Write Change on the destination, so the message states the requirement rather than the failing identity — and naming which one failed would leak impersonation internals. It mirrors the existing \"move not permitted\" message just above (the ABANDON/CREATE_CHANGE check).",
