      "writtenOn": "2026-11-21T17:00:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is — the BatchUpdate guard does fire. But that guard resolves Write Change against ctx.getNotes(), i.e. the change\u0027s current (source) ref. A move relocates the change onto a different ref, and the destination is never covered by the guard. This explicit check closes that gap by requiring Write Change on newDest.",
      "parentUuid": "5fd11e93_a438579f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 177,
        "startChar": 6,
        "endLine": 180,
        "endChar": 7
